

Lenaneo taolo-ea-mohopolo: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Nnete.
>> a := Lethathamo ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Ntho ncha.
c ha-ho-fihla: ['greet:'] etsa: { Sephetho ngola: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Lenaneo hloekisa.
>> usedMemory1 := (Lenaneo mohopolo ? 0).




